  "footnotes": [],
  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 19 as printed (5 year rows; 昭和17; 13 court-pair rows).",
   "The 13 court-pair rows add up to the 昭和17 row in every column (期間 九十日以內 is nil throughout) — all reconcile.",
   "In every row (except 同 14, which has two [?] cells) 受理總數 = 舊受 + 新受; 處理總數 = sum of 種類 (棄却, 破棄全部, 取下, 其ノ他) = sum of the five 期間 columns; 受理總數 - 處理總數 = 取調中 + 停止 — all hold.",
   "Row '同 14', col '受理 — 新受': printed 3? (39 / 37 / 32) — last digit blotched; cell is [?] (受理 62 - 舊受 23 would imply 39). Row '同 14', col '未濟 — 取調中': printed 2? (20 / 23), blotched; cell is [?] (受理 62 - 處理 42 would imply 20).",
   "Row labels: each court row has two printed labels, 現法院 (left, with a vertical bracket group, 〃 = ditto of the 部) and 原法院 (right, in the bracket); written as \"現法院 ／ 原法院\", with 〃 kept as printed. 臺北地方法院 合議部 is the 現法院 of the first three rows; 高等法院 覆審部 / 上告部 head the last two groups.",
   "Header: the second 種類 column is small print, first character unreadable (…棄全部), written 破棄全部[?]; 期間 columns 三十日以內 / 六十日以內 / 九十日以內 / 百八十日以內 / 百八十日(一)以上 read from tiny stacked print (the last is \"百八十一日以上\")."
  ],
